<view class="page tutorial-page">
  <view class="topbar"><text class="topbar-back" bindtap="back">‹</text>新手实操<text class="topbar-tag">亲手走三步</text></view>
  <view class="steps">
    <view class="step {{stepIndex == 0 ? 'active' : 'done'}}">{{stepIndex > 0 ? '✓' : '1'}} 走棋</view>
    <view class="step {{stepIndex == 1 ? 'active' : (stepIndex > 1 ? 'done' : '')}}">{{stepIndex > 1 ? '✓' : '2'}} 夹吃</view>
    <view class="step {{stepIndex == 2 ? 'active' : (stepIndex > 2 ? 'done' : '')}}">{{stepIndex > 2 ? '✓' : '3'}} 挑吃</view>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{!completed}}">
    <view class="lesson-card">
      <view class="lesson-eyebrow">第 {{stepNumber}} 关 · 教学局面</view>
      <view class="lesson-title">{{title}}</view>
      <view class="lesson-instruction">{{instruction}}</view>
      <view class="legend"><text>● 黑棋：你</text><text class="red-side">● 红棋：对方</text><text>备用黑棋 {{reserve}} 枚</text></view>
    </view>
    <chess-board board="{{board}}" show-node-labels="{{true}}" bind:node="onNode" />
    <view class="feedback {{passed ? 'success' : ''}}">
      <view class="feedback-title">{{passed ? '✓ 本关完成' : '点黑棋，再点标记的空位'}}</view>
      <view class="feedback-text">{{message || '跟随棋盘标记亲手试一试。走错也没关系，可以继续尝试。'}}</view>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{passed}}" id="tutorial-next" class="gold-btn" bindtap="next">{{stepIndex == 2 ? '完成教学' : '下一关'}}</button>
    <button class="retry-button" bindtap="retry">重练本关</button>
  </block>
  <view wx:else class="completion-card">
    <view class="completion-seal">学</view>
    <view class="lesson-title">三步入门，准备开局</view>
    <view class="completion-line">✓ 沿直线走棋，不越过其他棋子</view>
    <view class="completion-line">✓ 夹吃：两枚己方棋夹住一枚对方棋</view>
    <view class="completion-line">✓ 挑吃：己方棋走到两枚对方棋中间</view>
    <view class="completion-note">吃子还需整条直线没有其他棋子、备用棋足够。被吃的位置由备用棋替换。对方最后一子不能夹吃，只剩两子不能挑吃。</view>
    <button class="gold-btn" bindtap="openTrial">免登录电脑试玩</button>
    <button id="tutorial-start-ai" class="retry-button" bindtap="startAi" loading="{{startingAi}}" disabled="{{startingAi}}">开始正式入门 AI · 微信登录</button>
    <view class="completion-note">你执黑棋先走。未登录时先微信登录，再开始对局并保存棋谱。</view>
    <button class="retry-button" bindtap="retry">重新学习</button>
  </view>
  <view class="tutorial-note">教学练习不计入个人棋力与对局记录；教学进度保存在本机。</view>
</view>
